WEBVTT

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:30.976
and could determine the way

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.184
that the presidential election
of 2020 turns out.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:38.143
For instance, did you know
that under our constitution

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:42.476
a presidential candidate
could actually lose the popular vote,

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.184
fail to get a majority
in the electoral college,

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:47.476
refuse to concede,

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.226
manipulate hidden mechanisms
in our government

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.351
and still get sworn in as the president
of the United States of America?

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:56.643
That's a true fact.

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.401
I know it sounds like some crazy
"House of Cards" episode,

00:00:59.435 --> 00:01:00.643
and I wish it was,